      {
        "id": 111993,
        "authorName": "یزدانپناه عسکری",
        "authorUrl": null,
        "commentDate": "2023-09-20T09:10:32.9033907",
        "htmlComment": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">9- دلت از نور عزت کامل آمد</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">***</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[یزدانپناه عسکری]</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">نور عزت <a href=\"https://rasekhoon.net/article/show/1003775/%D8%B4%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%B7-%D8%B4%D9%86%D8%A7%D8%AE%D8%AA-%D9%82%D8%B1%D8%A2%D9%86\">:</a><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />رفعت و بر پا داشتن&rlm; نور عزّت و آگاهی، و قدرت و اراده (أَنَّ الْقُوَّةَ لِلَّهِ جَمیعاً) ؛ (وَ آتَیْناهُ مِنْ کُلِّ شَیْ&rlm;ءٍ سَبَباً).<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />یَتَّخِذُ مِنْ دُونِ اللَّهِ ؛ أَخَذَتْهُ الْعِزَّةُ بِالْإِثْمِ&rlm; (خود اندیشی)؛ ثَمَناً قَلِیلًا ؛ (٨/ ١)؛ وَ تَقَطَّعَتْ بِهِمُ الْأَسْبابُ .<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />فاطر : ١٠ - مَنْ کانَ یُریدُ الْعِزَّةَ فَلِلَّهِ الْعِزَّةُ جَمیعاً إِلَیْهِ یَصْعَدُ الْکَلِمُ الطَّیِّبُ وَ الْعَمَلُ الصَّالِحُ یَرْفَعُهُ وَ الَّذینَ یَمْکُرُونَ السَّیِّئاتِ لَهُمْ عَذابٌ شَدیدٌ وَ مَکْرُ أُولئِکَ هُوَ یَبُور<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />الکهف : ٨٤ - إِنَّا مَکَّنَّا لَهُ فِی الْأَرْضِ وَ آتَیْناهُ مِنْ کُلِّ شَیْ&rlm;ءٍ سَبَباً<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />البقرة : ١٦٥ - وَ مِنَ النَّاسِ مَنْ یَتَّخِذُ مِنْ دُونِ اللَّهِ أَنْداداً یُحِبُّونَهُمْ کَحُبِّ اللَّهِ وَ الَّذینَ آمَنُوا أَشَدُّ حُبًّا لِلَّهِ وَ لَوْ یَرَی الَّذینَ ظَلَمُوا إِذْ یَرَوْنَ الْعَذابَ أَنَّ الْقُوَّةَ لِلَّهِ جَمیعاً وَ أَنَّ اللَّهَ شَدیدُ الْعَذاب&rlm;<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />البقرة : ٢٠٦ - وَ إِذا قیلَ لَهُ اتَّقِ اللَّهَ أَخَذَتْهُ الْعِزَّةُ بِالْإِثْمِ فَحَسْبُهُ جَهَنَّمُ وَ لَبِئْسَ الْمِهاد<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />التوبة : ٩ - اشْتَرَوْا بِآیاتِ اللَّهِ ثَمَناً قَلیلاً فَصَدُّوا عَنْ سَبیلِهِ إِنَّهُمْ ساءَ ما کانُوا یَعْمَلُون&rlm;<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />البقرة : ١٦٦ - إِذْ تَبَرَّأَ الَّذینَ اتُّبِعُوا مِنَ الَّذینَ اتَّبَعُوا وَ رَأَوُا الْعَذابَ وَ تَقَطَّعَتْ بِهِمُ الْأَسْبابُ&rlm;<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #2f2f2f; font-family: IRANSans, tahoma, arial, \"Times New Roman\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />(الإسب: تارهای مرکز اراده و حرکت)</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://hedayatgar.ir/fa/news/4640/%D8%A8%D8%AD%D8%AB%D9%89-%D9%BE%DB%8C%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%85%D9%88%D9%86-%D9%86%D9%88%D8%B1-%D8%B9%D8%B2%D9%91%D8%AA-%D8%A7%D8%A8%D9%87%D8%AC\">______</a></p>",
